{"seq":1,"slug":"health-insurance-moral-hazard-adverse-selection","title":"医疗保险、道德风险与逆向选择","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/health-economics/supply-insurance/health-insurance-moral-hazard-adverse-selection","wordCount":1679,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"医疗保险-道德风险与逆向选择\">医疗保险、道德风险与逆向选择</h1><p>1971 年到 1982 年间，美国兰德公司花费近 3 亿美元，把约 7700 名参与者随机分配到免赔额从 0% 到 95% 不等的不同保险方案中，只为回答一个看似简单的问题：当看病更便宜时，人们会不会看更多病？这场被称为 RAND 健康保险实验的研究，至今仍是健康经济学最权威的因果证据，它把上一章<a href=\"../foundations/market-failure-information-asymmetry\">市场失灵与信息不对称</a>中抽象界定的道德风险，变成了可量化的数字。这一篇就把保险经济学的两大难题——道德风险与逆向选择——展开成完整的模型与实证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>保险的本质是风险共担：许多人各交一笔确定的保费，汇成一个池子，用来赔付少数人遭遇的大额损失。它之所以能创造价值，根源在<a href=\"../foundations/intro-and-special-nature-of-health\">健康的特殊性</a>中讲的风险厌恶——人们愿意为「免于灾难性支出」支付溢价。但保险一旦介入，被保险人和保险公司之间的信息不对称就会激活道德风险与逆向选择，反过来侵蚀保险的效率。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[保险: 风险共担] --&gt; B[价值: 对冲灾难性支出]&#10;  A --&gt; C[副作用: 信息不对称被激活]&#10;  C --&gt; D[道德风险&lt;br/&gt;事后过度就医]&#10;  C --&gt; E[逆向选择&lt;br/&gt;事前病人扎堆]&#10;  D --&gt; F[共付 免赔额 共保]&#10;  E --&gt; G[强制参保 风险调整 等待期]&#10;  F --&gt; H[在风险保护与效率间权衡]&#10;  G --&gt; H\">graph TD\n  A[保险: 风险共担] --&gt; B[价值: 对冲灾难性支出]\n  A --&gt; C[副作用: 信息不对称被激活]\n  C --&gt; D[道德风险&lt;br/&gt;事后过度就医]\n  C --&gt; E[逆向选择&lt;br/&gt;事前病人扎堆]\n  D --&gt; F[共付 免赔额 共保]\n  E --&gt; G[强制参保 风险调整 等待期]\n  F --&gt; H[在风险保护与效率间权衡]\n  G --&gt; H</pre><p>保单设计的全部艺术，就是用各种成本分担工具，在「给被保险人足够保护」和「不让他们过度使用」之间找平衡。下表汇总三类核心成本分担工具。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n<th>控制的问题</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>免赔额 (deductible)</td>\n<td>一定额度内全自付</td>\n<td>道德风险（小病滥用）</td>\n<td>可能延误必要就医</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>共付 (copayment)</td>\n<td>每次就诊付固定金额</td>\n<td>道德风险</td>\n<td>对低收入者负担重</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>共保 (coinsurance)</td>\n<td>按比例分担费用</td>\n<td>道德风险</td>\n<td>大病自付额仍可能很高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>封顶/自付上限</td>\n<td>超过上限保险全付</td>\n<td>保护大病患者</td>\n<td>削弱对大额支出的约束</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"道德风险-当看病的边际成本变成零\">道德风险：当看病的边际成本变成零</h2><p>道德风险的经济学机理可以用一张需求曲线讲清楚。无保险时，患者面对完整价格 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>，消费量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。有了共保比例 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span>（比如自付 20%），患者感知到的价格降为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">cP</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>，于是沿需求曲线移动到更高的消费量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。多出来的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>Q</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_1 - Q_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 部分，是患者在「价格被压低」下才会购买的服务——其边际价值低于真实边际成本，构成福利损失（无谓损失）。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>患者感知价格</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>P</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mi>c</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{患者感知价格} = c \\cdot P, \\quad c \\in [0, 1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">患者感知价格</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>RAND 实验给出了这个机制的经典估计：免费医疗组比 95% 自付组多花约 30%–45% 的医疗费用，主要来自<strong>就诊次数增多</strong>而非每次更贵。更重要的发现是，这些额外的医疗服务对绝大多数人的健康几乎没有改善——证明相当一部分是低价值的道德风险消费。但对穷人和高血压患者等特定群体，成本分担确实损害了健康，这提醒我们成本分担是把双刃剑。</p>\n<p>道德风险不只发生在患者端。医生作为供给方同样会因「反正保险付钱」而过度供给，这种供给侧的过度行为有其独立的逻辑，详见<a href=\"provider-supply-induced-demand\">医疗服务供给与诱导需求</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"逆向选择与死亡螺旋\">逆向选择与死亡螺旋</h2><p>逆向选择的机理在上一章已界定：健康状况是私人信息，高风险者最想投保。若保险公司只能按平均风险定价，结果是健康人觉得保费不划算而退出，留下的人平均风险更高，保费被迫上调，更健康的人继续退出——这个自我强化的过程就是死亡螺旋，理论上可使市场完全瓦解。</p>\n<p>用一个简化表述：设保费按池内平均风险 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>r</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{r}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 定价，健康人的真实风险 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>r</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{low} &lt; \\bar{r}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6891em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>w</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r_{low}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 远低于保费时他们退出，使 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>r</mi><mo>ˉ</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\bar{r}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5678em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1944em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˉ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 上升，门槛进一步推高。阻断螺旋的关键，是不让健康人能轻易选择退出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"应对逆向选择的制度工具\">应对逆向选择的制度工具</h2><p>各国保险制度的许多设计，本质都是为对抗逆向选择：</p>\n<p><strong>强制参保</strong>是最直接的手段——把健康人和病人强行放进同一个池子，平均风险被拉低，螺旋无从启动。这也是社会医疗保险与全民覆盖制度的核心逻辑，将在<a href=\"../systems-policy/health-financing-universal-coverage\">卫生筹资与全民健康覆盖</a>中展开。</p>\n<p><strong>风险调整</strong>让政府或监管者在不同保险计划间转移资金，补偿那些恰好吸引了更多高风险投保人的计划，从而消除保险公司「挑健康人」（撇脂）的激励。</p>\n<p><strong>等待期与既往症条款</strong>在历史上曾被用来防止人们「等病了才投保」，但因损害可及性，许多国家已通过立法禁止基于既往症拒保——这又把问题推回到「必须强制参保」的逻辑上。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>问题</th>\n<th>不干预的后果</th>\n<th>主要应对</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>逆向选择</td>\n<td>死亡螺旋、市场瓦解</td>\n<td>强制参保、风险调整</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>撇脂（挑健康人）</td>\n<td>高风险者无保可投</td>\n<td>风险调整、禁止既往症拒保</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>道德风险</td>\n<td>过度就医、保费高企</td>\n<td>共付、免赔额、管理式医疗</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"管理式医疗-另一条控制道德风险的路\">管理式医疗：另一条控制道德风险的路</h2><p>除了让患者分担成本，还有一条思路是直接管理供给行为，这就是管理式医疗（managed care）。它通过守门人制度（必须经全科医生转诊）、事前审批、按人头付费（capitation）等方式，把控制过度使用的责任部分转移给供给方。这与单纯的成本分担形成互补——前者管需求侧，后者管供给侧。按人头付费如何重塑医生激励，与<a href=\"provider-supply-induced-demand\">医疗服务供给与诱导需求</a>中的支付方式讨论紧密相连。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>保险的价值在于对冲风险厌恶者的灾难性支出，但会激活道德风险与逆向选择。</li>\n<li>道德风险是事后过度使用：保险把患者感知价格降为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">cP</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span>，诱发低价值的额外消费；RAND 实验证实免费组多花 30%–45% 而健康几无改善。</li>\n<li>逆向选择是事前高风险者扎堆投保，可引发死亡螺旋、瓦解市场。</li>\n<li>应对道德风险靠成本分担（免赔额、共付、共保）与管理式医疗；应对逆向选择靠强制参保、风险调整、禁止既往症拒保。</li>\n<li>保单设计的核心是在风险保护与使用效率之间权衡，没有免费的午餐。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"医疗保险、道德风险与逆向选择","id":"医疗保险-道德风险与逆向选择"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"道德风险：当看病的边际成本变成零","id":"道德风险-当看病的边际成本变成零"},{"level":2,"text":"逆向选择与死亡螺旋","id":"逆向选择与死亡螺旋"},{"level":2,"text":"应对逆向选择的制度工具","id":"应对逆向选择的制度工具"},{"level":2,"text":"管理式医疗：另一条控制道德风险的路","id":"管理式医疗-另一条控制道德风险的路"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"医疗市场失灵与信息不对称","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/health-economics/foundations/market-failure-information-asymmetry"},"next":{"title":"医疗服务供给与诱导需求","url":"/l-doc-books/h/economics-finance/health-economics/supply-insurance/provider-supply-induced-demand"}}